---
description: |
  Detects the SOC Prime High-Order Sigma rule "When PUPs Grow Fangs Dragon
  Boss Solutions Left an Open Door on 25,000+ Endpoints".

  When PUPs Grow Fangs Dragon Boss Solutions Left an Open Door on 25,000+
  Endpoints

  The rule chains 5 stages of SOC Prime behavior rules by host. See
  `socprime::hos::chain` for the correlation and the resulting Detection
  Finding.
args:
  named:
    - name: timeframe
      type: duration
      default: 5min
      description: The time span that a chain must fit into.
    - name: threshold
      type: float
      default: 0.6
      description: The share of stages a host must cover, between 0 and 1.
    - name: tolerance
      type: duration
      default: 1min
      description: How far findings of a host may arrive out of time order.
---

// Generated by scripts/vendor.py from the SOC Prime HoS rule JVLEu7LOwbcg.
let $stages = {
  seq1: [
    "34fd38da-cb73-4582-8d29-c866ba4aa91c", // LOLBAS MsiExec Spawn Shell (via cmdline)
    "7784e5a8-6699-4f8e-94fa-fc97ac0ff498", // MsiExec Spawned by Shell Process (via cmdline)
  ],
  seq2: [
